{
  "presses": ["L-pinky-top", "L-ring-home", "R-index-bottom", "L-middle-bottom"],
  "locks": {
    "L-pinky-top": "O",
    "L-ring-home": "B",
    "L-middle-bottom": "M"
  },
  "note": "T3: symbols {M,O,S,Z} on {LPt, LPh, RIdb, Lmb}; rot after {L-middle-top, L-pinky-home, R-index-top-in} => LPt not rot => LPt=O; Lmb not rot => Lmb=M. From T1: {B,E,O,R} on {LPt,LRh,Lmb,RIhi}; with LPt=O and B/O only on {LPt,LRh} => LRh=B. T4 next self: press {LPt(O), LRh(B), Lmb(M), RIdb} to deduce RIdb=S/Z."
}

{
  "presses": ["L-pinky-top", "L-index-home", "L-ring-home", "L-middle-bottom"],
  "locks": {
    "L-ring-home": "B",
    "L-middle-bottom": "A"
  },
  "note": "T8: pressed {LPt,LRh,LMb,LIn} => {A,B,M,O}; rot keys {L-index-home,L-middle-bottom} => start T9: L-middle-bottom=A; L-index-home pre/post unknown=M/O; L-ring-home=B fixed (not rotated in T8). T9 press {LPt,L-index-home,LRh,LMb} + lock LRh=B, LMb=A. From T9 symbol list {A,B,M,O} infer which key is M/O once rotation info comes (esp if LPt or LIn rotates)."
}

{
  "presses": ["L-pinky-top", "L-middle-home", "L-ring-home", "L-middle-bottom"],
  "locks": {
    "L-middle-bottom": "A",
    "L-middle-home": "B",
    "L-ring-home": "F"
  },
  "note": "After T9(no rot): L-middle-bottom=A; L-middle-home=B; L-ring-home=F; L-index-home & L-pinky-top={M,O} swap. Now press {L-pinky-top,L-middle-home,L-ring-home,L-middle-bottom} to identify whether L-pinky-top is M or O (then L-index-home gets the other)."
}

{
  "presses": ["L-pinky-top", "L-index-home", "L-ring-top", "L-ring-home"],
  "locks": {
    "L-middle-home": "B",
    "L-middle-bottom": "A",
    "L-index-top": "L",
    "L-index-bottom": "H"
  },
  "note": "T14: from last set {B,L,M,O} with fixed O@L-pinky-top, M@L-index-home => L-middle-home=B, L-index-top=L. Therefore L-middle-bottom=A and L-index-bottom=H. Locked these 4. Next: chord [L-pinky-top,L-index-home,L-ring-top,L-ring-home] => ring-top/home are the two symbols besides {O,M}; then next turn swap L-ring-home->L-ring-bottom to resolve order."
}

{
  "presses": ["L-middle-home", "L-middle-top", "L-middle-bottom", "R-index-home-in"],
  "locks": {
    "L-middle-home": "B",
    "L-middle-top": "U",
    "L-middle-bottom": "A"
  },
  "note": "From T17: L-ring-top=Y, L-ring-bottom=C; L-middle-home/L-middle-bottom={A,B}. From T18 set {B,C,U,Y} on {L-middle-home,L-middle-top,L-ring-top,L-ring-bottom} and no rotations => L-middle-home=B, L-middle-top=U, hence L-middle-bottom=A. T19: presses {L-middle-home=B,L-middle-top=U,L-middle-bottom=A,R-index-home-in=?} => infer ? = 4th symbol."
}

{
  "presses": ["L-middle-home", "L-middle-top", "L-middle-bottom", "L-ring-home"],
  "locks": {
    "L-middle-top": "U",
    "L-ring-top": "Y",
    "L-ring-bottom": "C",
    "R-index-home-in": "V"
  },
  "note": "Known now: L-ring-top=Y, L-ring-bottom=C, L-middle-home=B, L-middle-top=U, L-middle-bottom=A, R-index-home-in=V. This turn press [L-middle-home,L-middle-top,L-middle-bottom,L-ring-home]; observed set should be {A,B,U,?}. If rotation notice shows rotations only among these pressed keys (or none), deduce L-ring-home=4th symbol; else mark uncertain and use rotation list to adjust."
}
